# NOT the whole .streamlit directory: config.toml is the deployed theme — the
# colours, fonts and chart palettes Streamlit paints its own widgets with. Ignore
# it and the public dashboard renders half-styled, with no build error to say so.
# Only the secrets file must stay out of the image.
.streamlit/secrets.toml
*.log
data/
backups/
agent-transcripts
docs/plans
evaluation
n8n
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
